WEBVTT

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.210
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:04.990
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.240
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.550
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.250
This time, everyone will play in the snow!

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.430
And that means snowball fights!

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.620
No, no. Making snowmen.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.960
Grilling mochi in a snow hut would be nice, too. 

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.590
There are so many fun things to do!

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.290
Doki!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.230
Yes! Yes!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.100
Let's go!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.220
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.980
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.660
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:49.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.810
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.310
Every dream I've ever had! 

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:02.070
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:08.170
What kind of person will I be today? 

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:13.430
What counts is being true to yourself! 

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.610
Going somewhere?

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.010
Take it to the finish! 

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.510
You'll always be able to 

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:26.430
unlock your heart.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.340
So keep on changing! 

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.890
It's so exciting! 

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.930
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.650
Straight ahead!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.590
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:59.890
Ah, that was refreshing.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:03.290
You worked hard this New Year's.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.620
You can say that again.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.390
An encounter like a shooting star.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.020
I wonder what that meant?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:13.880
Whatever!

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:14.960
Time for bed!

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.270
An encounter like a shooting star?

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.680
Means this?!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:40.270
Episode 65
Snow Days are Full of Secrets?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.470
What's going on? 

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.840
Why is Ikuto in my bed?!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.640
He must have mistaken your bedroom for his.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.220
As if that'd ever happen!

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.330
It's the dawn of a great love affair, I see.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.910
Keep it down-nya!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:07.100
Yoru!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.410
Come here! Explain this!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.110
What the heck is going on?!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.310
C-Calm... C-C-Calm do- Calm down-nya!

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:19.310
Ikuto and I tricked that Director guy and got his violin back from Easter-nya!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.970
But then he... 

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.410
Ikuto, are you okay?

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.800
Cold... Tired... 

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.200
I-If you go to sleep now you'll die-nya!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.230
Just five minutes...

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.090
You can't! Not even five minutes!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.070
This ain't good-nya.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.200
Is there a warm place nearby where he can sleep?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.680
Um, um...

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.280
Ikuto, don't give up till the bitter end-nya!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.550
Character Transformation!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.150
Ikuto, keep moving-nya!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.180
So he found his violin?

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:16.570
Right, and it was my bright idea to bring him here-nya.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.990
Got that, Little Miss X? 

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:20.520
It all makes perfect sense. 

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.400
What did you say?!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.010
Ikuto, come on, wake up!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.160
And then get out!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.300
Come on... 

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.180
Amu-chan, you awake?

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:33.240
It's your dad.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:36.030
What'll we do, Amu-chan? This is <i>not</i> good! 

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.040
You've gotta do something or else... 

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:37.060
Do what, though?

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:42.410
What's the matter? I heard shouting. 

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.280
Huh?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.240
He's... so close.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.460
I can feel his breath.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.830
Must've been my imagination.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.620
I told you to wake up! 

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.940
Better not yell or your dad'll come back. 

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.400
I'm gonna catch a few winks-nya.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.620
And, he's asleep. 

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:25.060
He looks so defenseless, sleeping like that.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:29.120
Younger, somehow, than he usually seems.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.180
What am I saying? Forget that! 

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.290
How am I supposed to sleep?!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.240
I didn't sleep a wink.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.720
And it's already morning, and he's <i>still</i> here.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.990
Good morning, Amu-chan.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.590
How are Ikuto-san and Yoru?

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.770
Still sleeping like babies. 

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:56.260
He must be in rough shape if he still hasn't woken up. 

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.710
Sis!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.120
Wh-What is it?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.490
Eveting is white!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.150
So pretty! 

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.360
Wow!

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:17.330
We sure did get a lot of snow.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:21.060
It's like the whole city has been topped with whipped cream.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.970
Don't tell me... Ikuto?

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:26.620
It's Mr. Kitty!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.970
Oh? He don't have whiskers. 

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:36.190
We searched throughout the night, but could not locate him.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.620
He has yet to return home. 

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.230
Is that so?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.220
Search his school, check with his friends. Look everywhere. 

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.020
We must flush him out at all costs. 

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.250
How long is he going to sleep? 

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.710
It's been so long since we've had this much snow.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.320
I's gonna build a big snowman!

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.220
Bigger dan Mommy or even Daddy! 

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:07.970
That's sounds wonderful, but our yard isn't big enough. 

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:10.810
But I wanna! I wanna! 

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.690
Oh, I have an idea. Couldn't you build one at the school?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.820
School?

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:18.970
Take me, take me!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:20.270
If you wouldn't mind, Amu-chan?

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:22.630
W-Wait a sec, today's not really... 

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.600
We's gonna build a snowman!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.830
It's all white eberywhere!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:36.010
Ami, we're going home right after you finish it, okay?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:36.910
Okay!

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:41.750
I sure hope my parents don't discover Ikuto while I'm gone.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.060
Yoru's still with him.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.290
I'll take care of Ikuto-nya.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.250
You ain't got nothin' to worry about-nya.

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.940
Should I really have left them? 

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.350
You beat us here, Amu-chi!

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.280
Yaya? Guys?  

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.750
Here I thought I was the most fired up this morning.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.630
I wanted to be the first one to leave footprints.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.840
Did you all come to play in the snow, too?

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.180
More like dragged along.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.910
I was out shopping and Yaya caught me.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.340
Same for me.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.240
I was called here by the Chairman.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.630
And so, since we're all here anyway... 

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.100
Let's play our hearts out!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:25.190
This is not the way I imagined things would go.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:30.090
I's buildin' a snowman dat's gonna be <i>dis</i> big!

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.720
That sounds great! 

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.520
They're both such children.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:38.760
Take that!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.820
Rima, you're funny!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.320
Hey, what the heck was that for?!

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.400
You're gonna lose out if you don't enjoy days like today. 

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.600
Like this! 

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.590
My turn! 

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:52.640
Mine, too! 

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.680
This feels great!

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.020
Let me try! 

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:04.590
It really does! This mound of snow is all soft and fluffy! 

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.910
I wonder if Ikuto's awake.  

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.820
Oh yeah, what's he going to do for food?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.080
He hasn't had anything to eat since yesterday. 

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.180
Hinamori-san, something wrong? 

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:31.250
Huh? T-Tadase-kun!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.060
You seem a bit out of sorts. 

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:35.720
Oh, it's nothing... really...

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:39.010
Ikuto, wake up already-nya. 

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.550
Ikuto! Are you okay? Do you need anything?

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.960
Right, water. Just wait there-nya.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:55.810
It's heavy.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.010
I wonder if Ami-chan will like it.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:02.630
Huh?

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:06.740
Why is the refrigerator door open?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.300
A-ha! I'll just take some of this snow-nya.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.980
Ikuto!

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.320
Rats, he fell asleep again-nya.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.040
I should still give him some water.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:32.820
I've never seen Ikuto so weak before. 

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.230
He might be feeling even worse right now.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.770
Yeah, I've got to go home!

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:43.640
Rollin', rollin', rollin' up the snowman!

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:46.870
Rollin', rollin', rollin' up the snowman!

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.870
Ami-chan certainly is enjoying herself. 

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.060
It doesn't look like they're in a "go home" mood.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:51.570
That's it!

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:55.530
We'll just finish the snowman up quick, and then we can hurry home! 

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:59.480
Super Optimistic

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.480
That's quite the positive attitude.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.340
Roll, roll!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.500
Whoa, Amu-chi, you're totally psyched all of a sudden!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.050
Sweet, I'll help, too!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:09.470
Don't forget us. 

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.610
You can do it!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.670
Oh? What's the matter?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.670
My urge to create has also been piqued!

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.190
All done! 

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:24.410
Since we've finished building the snowman, it's probably time to-

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.010
Here!

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.470
Dechu!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.340
Hey! How dare you treat the King in such a manner! 

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.060
Snowball fight!

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:33.510
Take dat! 

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.350
Finished!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.840
You meany! 

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.800
Yaya!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.840
I'm sorry, Rima-tan!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.480
Wait right there, Yaya!

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:52.300
Oh, so we're having a snowball fight now.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.870
It's never going to be time to go home. 

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.350
Fine! If that's the way it's gonna be, I'm in! 

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:05.330
I'll play with Ami full-on until she's tired out, and <i>then</i> we can go home!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.580
Genius! 

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.350
I'm so hungry-nya.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.710
The snowball fight is still going on.

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.280
Take my super fastball!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.650
Yaya-chan Attack!

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.250
Hey!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.600
Man, I shouldn't be goofing off. 

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.760
It's your fault for spacin' out, Amu-chi!

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:47.180
Oh yeah? Well then, wait right there!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.300
But she's been playing to her heart's content. 

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.690
Advance! Commence the attack!

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:53.790
Roger!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.400
What's the matter? Are you tired?

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.340
No.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:11.010
It's just, when I look at the Guardian Characters, I get to thinking... 

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.250
Oh, right. Temari. 

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.660
Seeing them brings to mind the fact that I can't see Temari anymore. 

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.630
Guardian Characters truly are mysterious beings. 

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:26.560
Yeah. It's such an everyday thing for me to have Kiseki around now. 

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.240
But I wonder what Guardian Characters really are.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.720
I think Character Bearers follow different patterns. 

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.630
First come those who consider themselves complete as they are, 

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.670
but as they seek to improve themselves, 

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.840
a Guardian Character is born.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:50.630
See? People who, even if they Character Change, don't act all that differently. 

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.670
Like Soma-kun and Yaya-chan.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:14:00.590
Secondly, those who consider themselves inadequate and search for who they truly wish to be.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:04.120
A Guardian Character is born from what they feel they lack. 

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.060
Like Amu-chan and you, Hotori-kun.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.800
Temari and I were that type as well, I think.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:15.190
Temari and the unnamed egg... 

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:19.170
I wonder what's in store for them. 

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.270
Just about ready, I think. 

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.160
Everyone is in high spirits. 

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.640
But I wonder where he is watching the snow from.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:48.500
You may have found your treasure, but it seems you've lost your way. 

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.040
Ikuto.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.980
There's definitely something strange about this violin-nya.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.390
It's to blame for... 

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.090
Somebody's coming-nya!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.590
Ikuto! Wake up-nya!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.050
I-ku-to! 

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.590
You leave me no choice. 

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:26.630
I've got to stop them from coming in.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.680
This won't do it-nya!

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.190
Coming!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.080
Ikuto? You came to-nya?

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.520
Are you okay now?

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.830
This isn't my room.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.920
Still half asleep?

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.720
You and your low blood pressure...

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.730
6th Grade Star Class
Hinamori Amu

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.850
Is this Amu's room?

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:12.710
Why am I here?

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:14.000
If only you knew... 

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:15.570
The violin!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.380
She's coming back-nya!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.040
Vacuuming, yay! 

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.140
My word... 

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.220
I'm beat!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.920
We kept finding reasons to keep playing around.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.800
I've <i>really</i> got to get home now!

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.370
Hey, shouldn't w-

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.300
All done! 

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.810
What is <i>that</i>?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.290
I fear my own talent!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.930
Truly, I am a genius.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.180
Fweaky face! 

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.180
Maybe we should take a little break.

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:14.880
But if you look at it from this angle, it's much-

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.800
Hey, why don't we all go over to someone's house?

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.690
Out of everyone here, the closest is...

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.970
Amu-chi's, right?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.640
Not my house! It's, uh... super dirty and...

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:32.830
Is it? When I stopped by the other day, it was quite tidy. 

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.840
And the interior was just lovely. 

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:38.580
You've been in Hinamori-san's room?

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.790
I was with him at the time, though.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:41.970
I see.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:44.220
All right, then we're invading Amu-chi's house!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.740
I said you can't!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.370
It's a total disaster now and...  

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.900
Uh, right!

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.070
Ami, aren't you getting hungry?

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.950
It's practically time for dinner.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.960
Oh, it is. Look at the time.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:18:00.730
See? If you're late getting home, your families will all be worried! 

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:04.180
I suppose so. Perhaps we should get going. 

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.430
All right! We're dismissed for the day.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:10.770
But I wanted to play some more. What a letdown. 

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.140
I managed to fool them.

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.190
Step right up! Hot off the grill! 

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.910
I wanna eat some taiyaki!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.570
It's almost time for dinner. Can't you hold out a bit longer?

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.930
No! Want, want! 

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:30.020
Taiyaki, taiyaki, taiyaki, taiyaki, taiyaki, taiyaki, taiyaki.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.910
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:29.860
