00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:30.640
Roger!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:35.400
Mister, one taiyaki please!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:33.460
Chocolate-flavored?

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.250
Coming right up.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:39.520
We're home!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.300
Home!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.340
