00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:07.800
Did he go home?

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:12.630
All right, good riddance. 

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:16.590
I wasn't even worried about him. I'm relieved he's finally gone. 

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.180
